Subject: [PATCH 32/32] Plugins: NC's character pages and the game's icons
 (Armory)

a2.web.get may read NC's character pages (aion2.plaync.com/api/character/:
a character's profile, stats, gear, skills, Daevanion boards) and its
character search (api-search.plaync.com/aion2global/search/), read only.
The new a2.web.image hands a plugin a picture from the game's icon server
(assets.playnccdn.com) or NC's character portraits (profileimg.plaync.com)
as a data: URL, since a plugin's page loads nothing itself. Each host needs
the permission web:<host>; net_guard lists the four places.
